  message: "Cross-item review 2026-05-17: forms the verify-claims-2026-05-16 triad with WI-dozon and WI-bibuk — three disjoint subsets of the same 7/18 violations from the self-analysis run. This item: genuine wrapper-gap subset (real bug — Path.mkdir not yet covered by safety_zones). WI-dozon: short-name-collision FP subset (str.replace, platform.system — taint_refine scope expansion). WI-bibuk: claim-too-strict subset (subprocess→host_fs zone collapse — claim YAML and/or AUTO_SINK_ZONE_MAP need revision). All three should clear together for the 'verify-claims --claims docs/hypergumbo.claims.yaml passes' invariant; landing only one risks claims appearing to pass while the structural gap remains."  # 6da9
